Polymorphism ka matlab hota hai “many forms”
👉 Ek hi cheez ka alag-alag forms mein behave karna.


🌍 Real Life Example:-
water - liquid,gase ice etc 
shape - circule , rectangle triangle etc 
sound - bark , song etc 


Types of Polymorphism :- 
1️⃣ Compile Time Polymorphism (Static polymorphism bhi bolte h)
→ Achieved by Method Overloading
-ye compiler ke through handle hota h
2️⃣ Run Time Polymorphism (Dynamic polymorphism bhi bolte h)
→ Achieved by Method Overriding
- JVM ke through handle hota h 

📌 difference :-
Method Overloading            | Method Overriding
-------------------------------------------------
1) same name                  | 1) same name
2) same class                 | 2) different class
3) Different arguments        | 3) same arguments
   - No. of arg.              |    - No. of arg.
   - Seq. of arg.             |    - Seq. of arg.
   - Type of arg.             |    - Type of arg.


